msgid "Develop Metal Gear."
msgstr "开发合金装备"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd13a
msgid "About the \"DEVELOP\" menu"
msgstr "关于“开发”菜单"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd15a
msgid "At Mother Base, you can develop weapons and items to use in missions."
msgstr "在母基地可开发任务中使用的武器与道具。"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd17a
msgid "To develop weapons, select \"WEAPONS.\""
msgstr "开发武器请选“武器”"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd19a
msgid "(不要)Lボタン・Rボタンで表示する武器のカテゴリーを切り替えることが出来ます。"
msgstr "(不要)可用L键・R键切换显示的武器类别。"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd1ba
msgid "Weapons that have already been developed will be displayed as shown here with the weapon's icon."
msgstr "已开发完成的武器会像这样显示武器图标。"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd1da
msgid "(不要)△ボタンで、その武器の詳細な性能を見ることが出来ます。"
msgstr "(不要)按△键可查看该武器的详细性能。"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd1fa
msgid "This icon indicates that the weapon is ready to begin development."
msgstr "此图标表示该武器可以开始开发。"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd21a
msgid "To begin development, you will need the amount of GMP (funds) shown here."
msgstr "开始开发需要此处显示的GMP（资金）。"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd23a
msgid "Remember that development cannot proceed unless you have enough GMP."
msgstr "请注意，GMP不足时无法进行开发。"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd51a
msgid "GMP is calculated based on the staff assigned to the Combat Unit."
msgstr "GMP根据分配到战斗班的士兵计算。"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd53a
msgid "(不要)開発中の武器・アイテムは、開発の進行度が表示されます。"
msgstr "开发中的武器和道具会显示开发进度。"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd55a
msgid ""
"(不要)開発中の武器・アイテムを再度選択することで、\n"
"開発を中止することが出来ます。"
msgstr "再次选择开发中的武器或道具，\n即可中止开发。"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd57a
msgid "(不要)開発を中止すると使用したGMPを元に戻すことが出来ます。"
msgstr "中止开发可返还已使用的GMP。"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd59a
#, c-format
msgid ""
"(不要)ただし、開発途中の武器の進行度は0%に戻ります。\n"
"注意してください。"
msgstr "但开发中的武器进度将归零。\n请注意。"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd5ba
msgid "This icon indicates that the weapon cannot be developed until additional requirements are met."
msgstr "此图标表示需满足额外条件才能开发该武器。"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd5da
msgid "Press <I=DEC> button to view the requirements that must be met."
msgstr "按<I=DEC>键查看需满足的条件。"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd5fa
msgid ""
"In this case, it looks like the R&D Team's level is not high enough.\n"
"You need to rescue soldiers during missions and assign them to the R&D team."
msgstr "此时研发班等级似乎不够。\n需在任务中救出士兵并分配到研发班。"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd61a
msgid "(不要)未開発の武器でも、△ボタンで性能を見ることは出来ます。"
msgstr "未开发的武器也可按△键查看性能。"

#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd63a
msgid "Develop more powerful weapons and items and use them to help you tackle more challenging missions."
msgstr "开发更强的武器和道具，助你挑战更艰巨的任务。"

